<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Online Courses</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }
    body, html {
      height: 100%;
      color: white;
      font-family: sans-serif;
      background-color: #121212;
    }

    header {
      background-image: url(https://img.freepik.com/free-vector/dark-wavy-colors-background_23-2148403785.jpg?t=st=1746052873~exp=1746056473~hmac=fc9a1542bf74949002f47bb411de45c2a5ffb04d2147874cd5af1be994a8d77c&w=996);
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      height: 100vh;
      position: relative;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
      padding: 20px 30px;
      position: absolute;
      width: 100%;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    nav .logo {
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    nav ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #00e5ff;
    }

    .menu-toggle {
      display: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .menu-toggle span {
      display: block;
      height: 3px;
      width: 25px;
      background: white;
      margin: 5px 0;
    }

    .hero {
      height: 100%;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 50px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 20px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .hero button {
      background: #00e5ff;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #000;
      border-radius: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .hero button:hover {
      background: #00bcd4;
    }

    section {
      padding: 80px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    section h2 {
      font-size: 35px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #00e5ff;
    }

    section p {
      font-size: 18px;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav ul {
        flex-direction: column;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
        position: absolute;
        top: 70px;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        display: none;
      }

      nav ul.open {
        display: flex;
      }

      .menu-toggle {
        display: block;
      }

      nav ul li {
        padding: 15px;
        text-align: center;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header id="home">
    <nav>
      <div class="logo">Online Courses</div>
      <div class="menu-toggle" onclick="toggleMenu()">
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
      </div>
      <ul id="menu">
        <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="#courses">Courses</a></li>
        <li><a href="#categories">Categories</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero">
      <h1>Start Learning Today</h1>
      <p>Explore top-rated online courses in programming, design, business, and more.  
         Learn from experts at your own pace anywhere, anytime.</p>
      <button>Browse Courses</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section id="courses">
    <h2>Our Courses</h2>
    <p>Browse a wide variety of courses including Web Development, Data Science, Graphic Design, and Digital Marketing, all designed to boost your career.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="categories">
    <h2>Categories</h2>
    <p>Choose from diverse categories like Programming, Business, Photography, Language Learning, Health & Fitness, and more tailored to your interests.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions or need support, feel free to reach out to us anytime. We are here to help you succeed on your learning journey.</p>
  </section>

  <script>
    function toggleMenu() {
      document.getElementById('menu').classList.toggle('open');
    }

    document.querySelectorAll('a[href^="#"]').forEach(anchor => {
      anchor.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        document.querySelector(this.getAttribute('href')).scrollIntoView({
          behavior: 'smooth'
        });
      });
    });
  </script>

</body>
</html>

